---
layout: layouts/page.njk
pagination:
  data: states
  size: 1
  alias: state
permalink: "/states/{{ state.slug }}/registration/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ state.name }} Vehicle Registration — Fees, Process & Documents"
  description: "How to register a vehicle in {{ state.name }}: registration fees, title transfer costs, required documents, and step-by-step process for new and used cars."
  breadcrumbs:
    - label: Home
      url: /
    - label: States
      url: /states/
    - label: "{{ state.name }}"
      url: "/states/{{ state.slug }}/"
    - label: Registration
---

<div class="prose-dark">
{% set guide = stateGuides[state.slug] %}
{% if guide and guide.registration %}
{% include "state-guides/" + state.slug + "/registration.html" %}
{% else %}

<h2 id="fees">{{ state.name }} Registration Fees</h2>

<div class="glass-card metallic-border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden carbon-panel my-8 not-prose">
  <div class="steel-header px-6 py-4">
    <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg">Fee Summary</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="px-6 py-5">
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.05]">
        <div class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-silver-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Registration Fee</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-white mt-1">{{ state.registrationFeeRange }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.05]">
        <div class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-silver-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Title Fee</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-white mt-1">{{ state.titleFee }}</div>
      </div>
      {% if state.plateFee %}
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.05]">
        <div class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-silver-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Plate Fee</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-white mt-1">{{ state.plateFee | feeLabel }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if state.registrationNotes %}
    <p class="text-silver-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">{{ state.registrationNotes }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

<p>Proof of insurance at the {{ state.name }} minimum ({{ state.insuranceMinimum }}) is part of getting the title and plates. The title fee on file is {{ state.titleFee }}, and the registration charge on file is {{ state.registrationFeeRange }}.</p>

<h2 id="renewal">Renewing a registration in {{ state.name }}</h2>

<p>The fee note above is the published {{ state.name }} registration rule, including any renewal term that note already states, and this page does not add {{ state.name | aan }} {{ state.name }} renewal cycle beyond that note.</p>
{% if state.emissionsDetails %}
<p><strong>{% if state.hasEmissions %}Emissions:{% else %}Emissions:{% endif %}</strong> {{ state.emissionsDetails }}</p>
{% elif state.hasEmissions %}
<p>{{ state.name }} lists an emissions program for gasoline vehicles. A vehicle operated only on electricity does not take that test.</p>
{% endif %}
{% if state.safetyInspectionDetails %}
<p><strong>Safety inspection:</strong> {{ state.safetyInspectionDetails }}</p>
{% elif state.hasSafetyInspection %}
<p>{{ state.name }} requires a safety inspection before registration.</p>
{% endif %}
{% if state.evRegistrationDetails %}
<p>{{ state.evRegistrationDetails }}</p>
{% endif %}

<h2 id="title-transfer">Title transfer in {{ state.name }}</h2>

<p>When a vehicle changes hands in {{ state.name }}, the title fee on file is <strong>{{ state.titleFee }}</strong>.{% if state.plateFee %} The plate charge on file is {{ state.plateFee | feeLabel }}.{% endif %} Read the fee note above for county add-ons, and confirm the current form with the {{ state.name }} motor vehicle office before you pay.</p>

{% endif %}
<div class="glass-card metallic-border rounded-2xl p-8 carbon-panel text-center my-10 not-prose">
  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Need Insurance for Your New Vehicle?</h3>
  <p class="text-silver-400 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">You will need proof of insurance before you can register your vehicle in {{ state.name }}. Compare rates from top carriers in minutes.</p>
  <a href="/go/insurance/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl btn-primary text-white font-bold text-sm">
    Compare {{ state.name }} Insurance Rates
    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"/></svg>
  </a>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[10px] text-silver-500/50">Affiliate link. We may earn a commission at no cost to you.</p>
</div>

</div>
